SUMMARY:Theme Class - Turn\, Spin & Play with Benne & Andrea
DTSTART:20261114T150000Z
DTEND:20261114T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T160000Z
LOCATION:Weerdsingel Westzijde 22\, 3514 AA Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Turns and spins are an essential part of our dancing! We'll work on them both solo and with a partner through focused drills\, exploring balance\, control and shape to make our turns smoother and more playful.
