BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - St Louis Basics / Refresher with Dolinde & Andrew
DTSTART:20261114T150000Z
DTEND:20261114T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T160000Z
LOCATION:Amsterdamsestraatweg 3\, 3513 AA Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:In this class we will go over the basics of St Louis Shag\, teach classic dancefloor moves and add some fun stuff for those that are comfy.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/gEqX3444eLste4UP8
