DTSTAMP:20261110T160000Z
LOCATION:Oude Kerkstraat 2\, 3572 TJ Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Not sure where to start when it comes to practicing and improving your dancing? We'll share how we structure our own trainings and explore practical tools you can start using right away.
