BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Injury Prevention Workshop with Sacha
DTSTART:20261115T153000Z
DTEND:20261115T163000Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T160000Z
LOCATION:Cremerstraat 253\, 3532 BS Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:The session is a small workout that covers the exercises that could act as a preventive measure for most of the overuse injuries possible in dancing. The goal is that the attendees leave with the knowledge of a 4/6 week plan that could build this workout into a warm up so they can use it when needed.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/EiF3bQ4haTpKNsJu5
UID:theme-class-sun-injury@swingdom2026
END:VEVENT
